.TH LSPCI 1 "July 31, 2026" "ReBSD"
.SH NAME
lspci \- list PCI functions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lspci
[
.B \-n
]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B lspci
prints the bus address, class, vendor and product identifiers, and revision
of every function found by the kernel PCI probe.
The information comes from the read-only
.B hw.pcidevices
kernel snapshot; the utility does not access PCI configuration space.
.PP
The
.B \-n
option prints the numeric PCI class and subclass instead of a class name.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sysctl (3)
